#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:2
msgid "Agent Skills"
msgstr "智能体技能"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:4
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab agent skills are repository-owned instructions that help coding "
"agents follow Isaac Lab workflows. They are markdown guidance assets, not "
"runtime Python packages. The library covers installing, building "
"environments, training, debugging, migrating, and contributing. Codex and "
"Claude discover the skills automatically from a repository checkout (see "
"`Discovery`_). The full catalog is in ``skills/README.md``."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 智能体技能是一组随仓库维护的说明，帮助编程智能体遵循 Isaac Lab 工作流程。它们是 Markdown 指南文件，不是运行时 "
"Python 软件包。技能库覆盖安装、环境构建、训练、调试、迁移和贡献代码等工作。Codex 和 Claude 会从仓库工作副本中自动发现技能，见 "
"`技能发现 <Discovery_>`_；完整目录位于 ``skills/README.md``。"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:11
msgid "Skill categories"
msgstr "技能分类"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:13
msgid ""
"Skills typically fall into two groups: ones you invoke and ones the agent "
"applies automatically. The groups are not exclusive. The audience directory "
"(``user/`` or ``developer/``) says who a skill is for."
msgstr ""
"技能通常分为两类：由用户调用的技能，以及由智能体自动应用的技能。两类并不互斥；``user/`` 或 ``developer/`` "
"目录表示技能面向的使用者。"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:17
msgid "Typically user-invoked skills"
msgstr "通常由用户调用的技能"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:18
msgid ""
"Ask for these by task or by name, for example ``/isaaclab-installing-isaac-"
"lab`` in Claude Code. They cover work you start yourself: installing Isaac "
"Lab, creating and converting environments, training and debugging RL, "
"choosing backends and presets, preparing assets for Newton, migrating from "
"Isaac Gym or Isaac Lab 2.x, and troubleshooting setup. They live under "
"``skills/user/``. Some maintainer tasks under ``skills/developer/`` are also"
" run on request: ``isaaclab-auditing-an-issue`` and ``isaaclab-triaging-"
"issue-backlog``."
msgstr ""
"可以描述任务或指定技能名称来调用，例如在 Claude Code 中使用 ``/isaaclab-installing-isaac-"
"lab``。这些技能处理由用户发起的工作：安装 Isaac Lab、创建和转换环境、训练和调试强化学习、选择后端和预设、为 Newton 准备资产、从 "
"Isaac Gym 或 Isaac Lab 2.x 迁移，以及排查安装问题。它们位于 "
"``skills/user/``。``skills/developer/`` 中部分维护工作也按需调用，例如 ``isaaclab-auditing-"
"an-issue`` 和 ``isaaclab-triaging-issue-backlog``。"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:25
msgid "Typically agent-automated skills"
msgstr "通常由智能体自动应用的技能"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:26
msgid ""
"The agent usually loads these on its own when a task matches the skill "
"description, following ``AGENTS.md``. They cover contribution conventions: "
"coding style, test audits, changelog fragments, environment docs "
"synchronization, and PR preparation. They live under ``skills/developer/``."
msgstr ""
"任务符合技能描述时，智能体通常遵循 ``AGENTS.md`` "
"自行加载这些技能。它们规定贡献代码时的约定，包括代码风格、测试审查、变更日志片段、环境文档同步和 PR 准备，位于 "
"``skills/developer/``。"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:30
msgid ""
"User skills also trigger automatically when a request matches their "
"description, so naming a skill is optional. Name it when you want to be sure"
" it is used."
msgstr "用户技能在请求符合其描述时也会自动触发，因此不必指定名称。希望明确使用某项技能时，可以直接点名。"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:34
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "目录布局"

#: source/developer-tools/agent_skills.rst:36
msgid "Skills live under the repository-level ``skills/`` directory:"
msgstr "技能位于仓库根部的 ``skills/`` 目录："

